<title>USA: Shell interim dividend increased 11.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Shell interim dividend increased 11.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc said its board declared an interim dividend of 86.4 pence per New York share, adding this represents an increase of 11.6 percent over the 1995 interim dividend.</p>
<p>The amount to be paid to holders of New York shares will be determined by the dollar/sterling exchange rate on November 4, Shell said.</p>
<p>At the current rate of one pound equals $1.56, the dividend is equial to $1.68 per Nedw York share, payable November 8 to holders of record October 1.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
